# Shell scripts in this package are executed inside Linux containers. This repo
# has no root .gitattributes and Windows clones run with core.autocrlf=true, so
# without this a CRLF checkout makes the shebang `#!/bin/sh\r`, which the kernel
# reports as "no such file or directory" — an error that names neither the file
# nor the line endings. Pin them.
#
# It lives in packages/ rather than the repo root because sync-oss.sh mirrors
# packages/ to the public repo but does not sync root-level files, and the
# container is built from that mirror.
*.sh text eol=lf
